WEBVTT

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:53.730
Long ago, a great light was cast
and the world was created.

00:01:54.866 --> 00:01:57.966
Light overflowed and
shone in every corner.

00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:05.903
The beautiful world brought forth
and flourished many living things.

00:02:07.666 --> 00:02:08.896
The world of light...

00:02:09.233 --> 00:02:12.333
Its prosperity seemed to last forever.

00:02:12.533 --> 00:02:18.473
However, foolish humans desired
not only light, but darkness as well.

00:02:18.966 --> 00:02:23.726
Their wish was granted,
and darkness appeared.

00:02:24.666 --> 00:02:28.966
It was the instant that
the darkness was born in this world.

00:02:57.766 --> 00:03:00.996
That's the place we seek.

00:03:05.933 --> 00:03:10.933
THE SHADOW COMES FORTH

00:03:22.933 --> 00:03:27.203
So that's how much progress
has been made?

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:28.500
Progress, progress!

00:03:29.066 --> 00:03:33.426
Yes! Your ambitions are being
realized rapidly, Lord Nene.

00:03:33.966 --> 00:03:38.466
We have already sent our men
to infiltrate the entire country.

00:03:40.433 --> 00:03:41.473
Bring them all.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:45.830
Bring every child who is blessed
with the power of Darkness!

00:03:46.233 --> 00:03:52.403
Bring them all to me!
To make this world mine!

00:03:52.966 --> 00:03:54.426
Mine, mine!

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:56.570
Yes, sir!

00:03:57.133 --> 00:03:59.233
Your wish is my command!

00:04:16.833 --> 00:04:18.433
What?!

00:04:19.066 --> 00:04:21.296
The Knight Master is
coming to this village?!

00:04:21.333 --> 00:04:22.003
Uh-huh.

00:04:22.033 --> 00:04:23.773
Hey, what's a Knight Master?

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:25.270
Don't you know?

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:27.730
A knight who has mastered
the military arts.

00:04:27.766 --> 00:04:30.566
I don't know much,
but I hear he's super strong.

00:04:31.866 --> 00:04:34.296
Right! Women fall in love with them!

00:04:34.333 --> 00:04:35.533
Men envy them!

00:04:35.833 --> 00:04:38.433
It's the number one dream job for kids!

00:04:38.566 --> 00:04:40.126
Why are you getting so excited?

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:41.870
It has nothing to do with you, Shu.

00:04:42.033 --> 00:04:43.403
Of course it does!

00:04:43.666 --> 00:04:46.826
I'm gonna meet the Knight Master
and become his apprentice!

00:04:46.866 --> 00:04:49.796
And by being
a Knight Master's apprentice,

00:04:50.966 --> 00:04:53.026
I can travel around the world!

00:04:53.066 --> 00:04:54.726
- Wow!
- Wow!

00:04:54.766 --> 00:04:55.766
All right, everyone!

00:04:56.133 --> 00:04:59.273
Let's go and find
this Knight Master now!

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:00.930
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

00:05:01.133 --> 00:05:03.603
Hey, wait up!

00:05:05.266 --> 00:05:07.826
Cripes, he can be such a headache!

00:05:35.566 --> 00:05:36.796
Knight Master!

00:05:41.033 --> 00:05:41.703
Oh...

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:44.100
What are you doing?!

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:46.770
It's your fault for running out
like that!

00:05:46.966 --> 00:05:49.326
You made a dent in my bike!

00:05:49.733 --> 00:05:53.473
Hey, worry about me more than
this silly piece of junk you made!

00:05:53.533 --> 00:05:54.873
What a rude thing to say!

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:57.370
And here I came because
I was worried about you!

00:05:57.400 --> 00:06:00.100
Quit treating me like a kid all the time!

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:02.970
If I say this, he says that.
Such a kid.

00:06:03.233 --> 00:06:05.573
Hey, we're both the same age!

00:06:05.833 --> 00:06:07.173
- Bro!
- Bro!

00:06:07.533 --> 00:06:09.673
And? Did you find the Knight Master?

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:11.630
It's not that easy!

00:06:12.133 --> 00:06:15.003
Besides, I don't even know
his name or what he looks like.

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:17.100
Then how do you plan to find him?

00:06:18.733 --> 00:06:19.873
I have a plan!

00:06:20.433 --> 00:06:23.033
And the perfect one at that!

00:06:23.166 --> 00:06:24.766
A plan? What kind of plan?

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:25.800
Isn't it obvious?

00:06:25.933 --> 00:06:28.903
We'll approach every stranger we see!

00:06:28.933 --> 00:06:30.903
- Great plan, Bro!
- Great plan, Bro!

00:06:31.233 --> 00:06:33.473
Isn't that like really inefficient?

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:36.130
Shut up! Anyway, let's go!

00:06:36.166 --> 00:06:37.326
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

00:06:37.833 --> 00:06:39.133
- Knight Master!
- Knight Master!

00:06:44.133 --> 00:06:46.273
W-What are you doing?!

00:06:46.733 --> 00:06:49.903
If he were a real Knight Master,
he would've dodged that.

00:06:51.166 --> 00:06:52.526
- Knight Master!
- Knight Master!

00:06:55.933 --> 00:06:57.903
Not him either.

00:07:03.433 --> 00:07:04.433
Knight Maâ€”

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:12.930
Not him either.

00:07:13.333 --> 00:07:14.633
Hey, hold it.

00:07:14.666 --> 00:07:16.696
Man, where is he?

00:07:16.833 --> 00:07:18.303
Knight Master...

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:20.500
I said hold it, you brat!

00:07:21.233 --> 00:07:21.903
Huh?

00:07:23.266 --> 00:07:25.466
First you approach someone,
then you ignore him.

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:27.830
You really don't have
any manners.

00:07:28.233 --> 00:07:32.433
Shut up! It's your fault for
walking around in this area.

00:07:32.933 --> 00:07:35.103
That's the only reason
I stopped you in the first place!

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:37.030
H-Hey, Shu...

00:07:38.766 --> 00:07:40.796
Shall I teach you
how to address others?

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:45.730
There's nothing a weak-looking guy
like you can teach me.

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:51.930
I...am not weak!

00:07:57.166 --> 00:07:58.166
I will show you!

00:08:04.433 --> 00:08:06.873
W-What is this feeling?

00:08:07.566 --> 00:08:08.566
Remember this.

00:08:09.133 --> 00:08:11.503
Rude speech and behavior
can put your life in peril.

00:08:21.266 --> 00:08:22.266
That's enough.

00:08:23.833 --> 00:08:24.503
Zola!

00:08:33.766 --> 00:08:35.766
Don't get involved in
senseless arguments, Jiro.

00:08:36.233 --> 00:08:37.333
But he...

00:08:37.666 --> 00:08:38.826
No excuses.

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:42.230
Besides, you tried to use your power.

00:08:43.633 --> 00:08:45.473
There's a time and place for everything.

00:08:45.766 --> 00:08:46.896
That's your weakness.

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:49.270
I-I'm sorry.

00:08:50.133 --> 00:08:52.573
My friend was rude. I apologize.

00:08:53.266 --> 00:08:55.266
No, he was to blame too.

00:08:55.733 --> 00:08:58.073
Hey Shu!
You need to apologize too!

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.130
Hey Shu!

00:09:00.833 --> 00:09:02.073
Let's go, Jiro.

00:09:03.066 --> 00:09:04.066
Wait!

00:09:16.633 --> 00:09:18.303
Oh! You're the Knight Master!

00:09:20.566 --> 00:09:24.196
Hey, Knight Master!
Make me your apprentice!

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:40.100
Hey, Knight Master!
Make me your apprentice!

00:09:43.733 --> 00:09:45.373
Knight Master, huh?

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:47.570
You want to become a Knight Master?

00:09:47.966 --> 00:09:52.196
Actually, I just want to be
an apprentice to a Knight Master.

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:55.130
You're a Knight Master, right?

00:09:55.766 --> 00:09:58.666
Unfortunately, I am not a Knight Master.

00:09:59.033 --> 00:10:03.173
And, if I speak in philosophical terms
of good and bad,

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:05.670
I may not even be your ally.

00:10:07.933 --> 00:10:11.203
You think you can become
a Knight Master?

00:10:11.266 --> 00:10:12.496
What?!

00:10:12.733 --> 00:10:14.233
Stop it, both of you.

00:10:15.633 --> 00:10:16.903
How old are you?

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.900
Huh? I'm ten.

00:10:19.566 --> 00:10:24.066
I see. Perhaps, you're the one.

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:25.670
Huh?

00:10:25.866 --> 00:10:27.166
I'll tell you one thing.

00:10:27.866 --> 00:10:30.896
A Knight Master never identifies himself.

00:10:31.233 --> 00:10:33.203
And others cannot make you one.

00:10:34.133 --> 00:10:36.573
Being strong isn't enough.

00:10:36.933 --> 00:10:39.273
The weak-hearted obviously
can never become one either.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:42.170
Now let me ask you.

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:45.800
What will you do if you possess power?

00:10:46.733 --> 00:10:48.733
Power? What will I do?

00:10:49.066 --> 00:10:54.496
If you cannot answer that question,
your journey will never begin.

00:11:15.066 --> 00:11:16.726
Sir, we are now passing over
the Gul Mountain Range.

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:21.470
Estimated time of arrival
at Target Area B34 is 1410.

00:11:22.233 --> 00:11:24.873
We will infiltrate from all directions.

00:11:25.133 --> 00:11:28.233
Once the area is secure,
begin the search.

00:11:28.666 --> 00:11:29.326
Roger.

00:11:31.233 --> 00:11:34.033
No matter who is lying in wait for us,

00:11:34.066 --> 00:11:37.626
as long as we have the power of
darkness granted by Lord Nene,

00:11:37.666 --> 00:11:39.396
we have nothing to fear!

00:12:06.533 --> 00:12:08.403
The Covalt Cavern of Dragon...

00:12:09.066 --> 00:12:12.326
The site where the raging power
was sealed.

00:12:36.566 --> 00:12:37.596
As I thought...

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:43.270
There is no mistake.

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:45.730
This is the place.

00:12:48.033 --> 00:12:52.973
Oh man! I guess that lady wasn't
a Knight Master.

00:12:53.566 --> 00:12:57.026
In any case, she turned you down.

00:12:57.066 --> 00:12:58.826
So you can't go on your journey.

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:02.630
By the way,
what was she saying to you?

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:08.070
I'm not really sure.
It was too hard to understand.

00:13:09.433 --> 00:13:11.003
- B-Bro!
- B-Bro!

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:19.170
W-What is that?

00:13:20.066 --> 00:13:21.066
What the hell?

00:13:34.933 --> 00:13:36.103
Our Talta Village!

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:39.230
You all stay here!

00:13:39.433 --> 00:13:40.633
What are you gonna do?

00:13:40.933 --> 00:13:42.973
I'm gonna go find that lady!

00:13:43.333 --> 00:13:47.133
They headed towards the valley!
They're probably at the ruins!

00:14:09.533 --> 00:14:11.473
Remember, do not kill the children!

00:14:12.433 --> 00:14:14.833
What about everyone else?

00:14:15.633 --> 00:14:17.673
Kill anyone who resists!

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.000
What's going on?

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:21.300
It's them.

00:14:22.633 --> 00:14:24.103
It seems they've attacked the village.

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:25.770
I see...

00:14:25.966 --> 00:14:27.426
Hey!

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:33.470
There's a shortcut!
I'll show you the way!

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:34.470
This way!

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:35.530
What are you talking about?

00:14:35.566 --> 00:14:39.166
What?! The village is being attacked!

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:42.230
That has nothing to do with us.

00:14:42.833 --> 00:14:43.503
Huh?!

00:14:43.666 --> 00:14:47.626
As I told you earlier...
We are not Knight Masters.

00:14:48.633 --> 00:14:53.403
If you want to save the village,
do it yourself.

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:55.370
What?!

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:57.200
This conversation is over.

00:14:58.700 --> 00:15:02.530
Oh, is that so?!
I won't ask you again!

00:15:07.766 --> 00:15:08.426
Shu!

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:10.000
- Bro!
- Bro!

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:13.000
Well? Did you find them?

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:18.230
Forget those two!

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:20.770
We'll protect the village ourselves!

00:15:41.666 --> 00:15:43.026
What do we do, Elder?

00:15:43.566 --> 00:15:44.826
We do nothing.

00:15:45.266 --> 00:15:49.166
If we don't resist,
they probably will not harm us.

00:15:56.133 --> 00:15:58.633
The time is calling for chaos.

00:16:10.966 --> 00:16:16.366
Oh? You dare to defy us?
Then I shall show you!

00:16:17.266 --> 00:16:18.266
Go!

00:16:38.633 --> 00:16:40.673
W-What's going on?!

00:16:40.766 --> 00:16:41.426
The village...

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.400
There are some children!

00:16:45.833 --> 00:16:49.273
Hey you! Now get over here.

00:16:50.133 --> 00:16:51.503
Who do you think you are?!

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:55.200
Get out of our village, now!

00:17:05.466 --> 00:17:06.466
How's that?!

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:07.670
- Bro!
- Bro!

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:10.600
Stop it!

00:17:13.266 --> 00:17:14.266
Kluke!

00:17:14.833 --> 00:17:16.903
Dammit! Get your hands off of everyone!

00:17:16.933 --> 00:17:19.203
Shut up! You're coming too!

00:17:19.233 --> 00:17:20.873
Don't touch me!

00:17:22.733 --> 00:17:25.303
Oww! You rotten brat!

00:17:28.133 --> 00:17:29.433
Take them away!

00:17:29.866 --> 00:17:31.026
What about that brat?

00:17:31.733 --> 00:17:33.073
Leave him to me!

00:17:33.566 --> 00:17:37.196
I'll teach him some manners.

00:17:37.533 --> 00:17:39.073
Don't go overboard.

00:17:39.166 --> 00:17:39.826
Shu...

00:17:39.866 --> 00:17:40.866
Let's go!

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:42.430
Stop!

00:17:43.066 --> 00:17:45.226
Shu! Shu!

00:17:54.366 --> 00:17:55.366
Take that!

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:00.930
Dammit.

00:18:01.566 --> 00:18:02.566
I...

00:18:03.133 --> 00:18:05.603
It seems everything is in place.

00:18:10.766 --> 00:18:14.526
If only I had some power!

00:18:18.933 --> 00:18:21.133
Damn!

00:18:37.033 --> 00:18:38.333
Knight Master?!

00:18:39.633 --> 00:18:40.633
What?

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:46.370
You follow my instructions on
when to use your powers. Got it?

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:47.470
Understood.

00:18:48.433 --> 00:18:49.103
Let's go!

00:19:06.933 --> 00:19:07.933
It's over!

00:19:13.033 --> 00:19:14.033
What are you looking at?

00:19:14.633 --> 00:19:16.433
No...well...

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:19.100
You don't even know how to
thank the one who saved you.

00:19:19.133 --> 00:19:20.373
Such a country bumpkin.

00:19:20.666 --> 00:19:24.796
What?! I never asked you to save me!

00:19:24.966 --> 00:19:26.826
I have no time to argue with you.

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:28.330
Get out of here.

00:19:28.533 --> 00:19:31.133
Hold it! Who are those guys?!

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:35.270
They're the army of
the Grankingdom. Nene's forces.

00:19:36.066 --> 00:19:37.666
Grankingdom?

00:19:38.466 --> 00:19:39.126
Nene?

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:46.870
I've heard of the two
who defy the Grankingdom.

00:19:48.866 --> 00:19:50.366
Everyone, stay back!

00:19:51.166 --> 00:19:53.296
They are my prey!

00:19:55.533 --> 00:19:59.433
My power surpasses all others!

00:20:11.533 --> 00:20:13.073
What is that?!

00:20:16.300 --> 00:20:19.600
Don't lump us together with
that sorry-looking Shadow.

00:20:20.333 --> 00:20:21.003
What?!

00:20:21.033 --> 00:20:23.633
Our Shadow is different!

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:42.130
The shadow turned into a beast!

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:46.700
So I just have to take that down?

00:20:46.766 --> 00:20:48.896
Right! Go, Goblin!

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:51.000
Get them!

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:04.130
You intend to battle
my Killer Bat with that?

00:21:04.166 --> 00:21:05.166
What?!

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:18.500
Now finish it!

00:21:28.100 --> 00:21:29.170
Right there!

00:21:38.633 --> 00:21:40.073
Kluke! Everyone!

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:43.530
Hey! Stop, or you'll die too!

00:21:44.466 --> 00:21:46.866
I... I...

00:21:47.400 --> 00:21:49.800
What will you do if you
possess power?

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:52.300
I want to protect everyone!

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:05.630
What is that?!

00:22:06.433 --> 00:22:07.733
Is that...

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:12.300
That is the power we have sought!

00:22:16.866 --> 00:22:18.226
Blue Dragon...

00:22:23.166 --> 00:22:24.826
Blue...Dragon...

00:24:22.266 --> 00:24:24.166
Shu awakens the Blue Dragon.

00:24:24.200 --> 00:24:24.870
However...

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:26.330
In exchange for its power,

00:24:26.366 --> 00:24:28.396
his body would have
to become a machine.

00:24:28.433 --> 00:24:30.533
Hey wait a minute! No way!

00:24:30.566 --> 00:24:31.726
What anime is this anyway?!

00:24:31.766 --> 00:24:35.126
Oh, then I'll be happy to modify you.
That's my specialty.

00:24:35.166 --> 00:24:37.466
Huh?! Stop!

00:24:37.500 --> 00:24:40.070
Next on Blue Dragon:
"The Blue Power"
